                                "sense_id": "c957dac4-f138-38f5-968f-73a313741437",
                                "text": "Nila began fumbling around in her purse. \"There is just one thing . . . \"\n\"What is it?\"\n“I have a daughter.” Nila pulled out a picture of Jasmine and handed it to Raima. She looked at the picture quickly and handed it back to Nila. “A daughter? Now how did you get away with that?” “It wasn't easy,” Nila said, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "804d17af-e09e-4e0d-9fed-3b85cde52ba5",
                                "sense_id": "c957dac4-f138-38f5-968f-73a313741437",
                                "text": "[…] They had one daughter Nila born April 9, 1945."
                            }
                        ]
